{
 "comment": "Xwayland / X11 items scored by tools/wl-conformance.mjs. Each item has source patterns (weight 1: a regular expression that must appear in the file, or in any file under a directory ending in /), unit tests (weight 1: build/<name> must pass) and the dynamic checks that server/tests/x11_conformance.c and the driver report under the same id (weight 3). Add an item or a pattern here; the X11 client reports its checks by item id.",
 "items": [
  {
   "id": "xwayland.startup",
   "title": "Xwayland startup and surface association",
   "static": [
    {
     "id": "on_demand",
     "file": "server/src/wl/xwayland.c",
     "pattern": "static int on_connect\\(",
     "what": "Xwayland starts on the first X11 connection (watched socket)"
    },
    {
     "id": "rootless",
     "file": "server/src/wl/xwayland.c",
     "pattern": "\"-rootless\"",
     "what": "Xwayland runs rootless with our WM on -wm"
